## Detailed Design

### 1. Request-Scoped DataLoader (Java / Netflix DGS)
Create a fresh `MappedBatchLoader` per request (never a singleton) with `maxBatchSize(100)`:

```java
@DgsDataLoader(name = "sellers")
public class SellerDataLoader implements MappedBatchLoader<String, SellerDto> {
    @Override
    public CompletionStage<Map<String, SellerDto>> load(Set<String> sellerIds) {
        return CompletableFuture.supplyAsync(() -> sellerGrpcClient.batchGetSellers(sellerIds));
    }
}
```

### 2. Query Depth & Complexity Instrumentation
Register `MaxQueryDepthInstrumentation(6)` and `MaxQueryComplexityInstrumentation(500)` on `GraphQL.Builder`.
